mall font-primary text-secondary-33" href="#que-es" data-brx-anchor="true">Qué es</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a id="brxe-10a2ba" class="brxe-text-link txt-body-small font-primary text-secondary-33" href="#beneficios" data-brx-anchor="true">Beneficios</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a id="brxe-ddb4fc" class="brxe-text-link txt-body-small font-primary text-secondary-33" href="#integra-card" data-brx-anchor="true">Integra Card</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a id="brxe-e00e33" class="brxe-text-link txt-body-small font-primary text-secondary-33" href="#soluciones" data-brx-anchor="true">Kit de Soluciones</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a id="brxe-f1eeec" class="brxe-text-link txt-body-small font-primary text-secondary-33" href="#como-funciona" data-brx-anchor="true">Cómo Funciona</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a id="brxe-89f34f" class="brxe-button bricks-button" href="https://integrapagos.com/contacto/">CONTACTO</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://www.instagram.com/integrapagos" target="_blank" aria-describedby="brx-new-tab-link-description" class="bricks-link-wrapper"><i id="brxe-knbctz" class="fab fa-instagram brxe-icon"></i></a></li></ul><button id="brxe-32fac4" data-script-id="32fac4" class="brxe-toggle brxa--boring" aria-label="Open" aria-expanded="false"><span class="brxa-wrap"><span class="brxa-inner"></span></span></button></nav></div></section></header><main id="brx-content"><section id="hero" class="brxe-section"><div id="brxe-wnvkzm" class="brxe-container"><div id="brxe-ifvbep" class="brxe-div"><h3 id="brxe-ivympi" class="brxe-heading font-primary txt-title-1 text-neutral-ff" data-interactions="[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;knggqh&quot;,&quot;trigger&quot;:&quot;enterView&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;startAnimation&quot;,&quot;animationType&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;,&quot;runOnce&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}]" data-interaction-id="dc9ec3" data-interaction-hidden-on-load="1">Soluciones<br>Financieras<br>Integrales</h3><div id="brxe-axtgup" class="brxe-text text-neutral-ff txt-body-semi-bold font-primary" data-interactions="[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;enfdmd&quot;,&quot;trigger&quot;:&quot;enterView&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;startAnimation&quot;,&quot;animationType&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;,&quot;animationDelay&quot;:&quot;.2s&quot;,&quot;runOnce&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}]" data-interaction-id="537977" data-interaction-hidden-on-load="1"><p>Facilitamos tus transacciones, potenciamos tu crecimiento. Únete a la red que entiende y apoya a los emprendedores y pequeños comercios.</p>
</div><a id="brxe-zrofyc" class="brxe-button bricks-button bricks-background-primary" data-interactions="[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;kiwwez&quot;,&quot;trigger&quot;:&quot;enterView&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;startAnimation&quot;,&quot;animationType&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;,&quot;animationDelay&quot;:&quot;.4s&quot;,&quot;runOnce&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}]" data-interaction-id="90bd94" data-interaction-hidden-on-load="1" href="https://integrapagos.com/contacto/">¡Contáctanos!</a></div></div></section><section id="que-es" class="brxe-section bg-neutral-f1"><div id="brxe-bvbcgi" class="brxe-container"><div id="brxe-ikdnii" class="brxe-div"><h3 id="brxe-gsoneq" class="brxe-heading txt-title-3 text-primary-violeta font-primary">Nacimos para Apoyar<br>a los Emprendedores</h3><div id="brxe-pylcxf" class="brxe-text txt-body-big text-secondary-33 font-primary"><p>En Integra Pagos, creemos en el poder de los pequeños negocios y emprendedores para transformar sus comunidades. Como parte de Cooperativa Firenze, estamos comprometidos con brindarte una alternativa justa y accesible para procesar pagos electrónicos, con comisiones que se adaptan al tamaño de tu negocio. Pero no nos detenemos ahí: somos una red completa de soluciones administrativas y financieras diseñadas para ayudarte a crecer de manera sostenible.</p>
<p><strong>Porque cuando creces, todos ganamos.</strong></p>
</div></div><div id="brxe-vnlvhz" class="brxe-div"><img loading="lazy" width="558" height="492" src="https://integrapagos.com/wp-content/uploads/emprendedor.png" class="brxe-image css-filter size-full" alt id="brxe-ytnpmn" data-interactions='[{"id":"raiggy","trigger":"enterView","action":"startAnimation","animationType":"fadeInRight","target":"self","runOnce":"1"}]' data-interaction-id="0ee3ea" data-interaction-hidden-on-load="1" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" /></div></div></section><section id="beneficios" class="brxe-section"><img loading="lazy" width="645" height="784" src="https://integrapagos.com/wp-content/uploads/element-gris.png" class="brxe-image css-filter size-full" alt id="brxe-fcbzgf" decoding="async" /><div id="brxe-gsmgjx" class="brxe-container"><h3 id="brxe-nbnnlr" class="brxe-heading font-primary txt-title-3 text-secondary-33">¿Por Qué Elegirnos?</h3><div id="brxe-vdbpfc" class="brxe-div brx-grid"><div id="brxe-vnbfjq" class="brxe-div" data-interactions="[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;jutnlw&quot;,&quot;trigger&quot;:&quot;enterView&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:&quot;startAnimation&quot;,&quot;animationType&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;,&quot;runOnce&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}]" data-interaction-id="dfda55" data-interaction-hidden-on-load="1"><svg class="brxe-icon" id="brxe-isccte" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="182" height="182" viewBox="0 0 182 182" fill="none"><path d="M90.9999 182C141.208 182 181.909 141.299 181.909 91.0912C181.909 40.8835 141.208 0.182068 90.9999 0.182068C40.7922 0.182068 0.0908203 40.8835 0.0908203 91.0912C0.0908203 141.299 40.7922 182 90.9999 182Z" fill="#00A4FF"></path><path d="M75.3214 129.694C74.8324 130.524 73.7728 130.798 72.9651 130.331C72.1278 129.842 71.861 128.79 72.3278 127.975C73.1874 126.5 74.7064 125.278 76.4921 124.418C78.3298 123.537 80.5157 122.996 82.42 122.922C85.6062 122.825 89.1332 123.707 92.6899 124.589C95.2167 125.226 97.736 125.841 99.996 126.063C102.641 126.33 104.212 125.745 104.872 124.841C105.064 124